OL,3,CCan a new Scottish Labour leader
OL,4,Creally save the party?
OL,6,FThe fight to become Scottish Labour's
OL,7,Fnext leader is well underway.
OL,9,FEither Joe Fagan or Michael Marra will
OL,10,Fhave to convince first party members,
OL,11,Fthen the wider electorate of their
OL,12,Fplan to turn around the fortunes of a
OL,13,Fparty that has been going backwards
OL,14,Fsince the first Holyrood election in
OL,15,F1999.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
