OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786983634
OL,3,CCan a new Scottish Labour leader
OL,4,Creally save the party?
OL,6,FThere are currently just 17 Labour
OL,7,FMSPs, even though the collapse of the
OL,8,FScottish Conservatives in May has left
OL,9,Fwhoever replaces Anas Sarwar as the
OL,10,Fleader of the joint largest opposition
OL,11,Fparty at the Scottish Parliament.
OL,13,FJoint largest with Reform UK.
OL,15,FBoth South Scotland MSP Mr Fagan and
OL,16,FNorth East representative Mr Marra
OL,17,Fhave promised radical overhauls
OL,18,Fwithout spelling out much detail.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
