CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786983634
OL,3,CCan a new Scottish Labour leader
OL,4,Creally save the party?
OL,6,FMr Fagan says he wants "to rebuild
OL,7,FScottish Labour as the party of the
OL,8,Fworking people of Scotland, rooted in
OL,9,Four communities, serious about using
OL,10,Fpower to change lives".
OL,12,FMeanwhile Mr Marra insists the party
OL,13,F"must rediscover our soul and
OL,14,Freconnect with Scotland".
OL,16,FPerhaps the most radical departure
OL,17,Ffrom previous Scottish Labour
OL,18,Fleaderships would have been Monica
OL,19,FLennon.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
