OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786983634
OL,3,CCan a new Scottish Labour leader
OL,4,Creally save the party?
OL,6,FThe Glasgow MSP ` who failed to get
OL,7,Felected in May but replaced Mr Sarwar
OL,8,Fon the city's regional list after he
OL,9,Fquit Holyrood for a peerage and a job
OL,10,Fin Andy Burnham's government ` won the
OL,11,Fsupport of the two largest trade
OL,12,Funions, Unison and Unite.
OL,14,FBut she couldn't muster the relatively
OL,15,Flow bar of a nomination from three
OL,16,FMSPs and three MPs.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
