CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786983634
OL,3,CCan a new Scottish Labour leader
OL,4,Creally save the party?
OL,6,FFormer MSP Neil Findlay said the
OL,7,Fdecisions of parliamentarians not to
OL,8,Fback Ms Lennon was "self-inflicted
OL,9,Fmisery" given her proven record as an
OL,10,Feffective campaigner.
OL,12,FOne Labour figure of the left was more
OL,13,Facidic as they suggested a contrast
OL,14,Fbetween Ms Lennon's style in public
OL,15,Fand in private: "Her support base is
OL,16,Fmainly people who have never had to
OL,17,Fwork with her."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
