OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786983634
OL,3,CCan a new Scottish Labour leader
OL,4,Creally save the party?
OL,6,FEven before the nominations were
OL,7,Fconfirmed, though, there was pessimism
OL,8,Fin some quarters about how long any
OL,9,Fpotential recovery would take Labour.
OL,11,F"We're looking at a two-cycle
OL,12,Frebuild," said one person close to Mr
OL,13,FSarwar as they predicted that none of
OL,14,Fthe candidates would win the 2031
OL,15,FHolyrood election.
OL,17,FThat may not be a bold claim given no
OL,18,FScottish Labour leader has even come
OL,19,Fclose to power since the SNP's first
OL,20,Fvictory in 2007.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
